 434+ 6ACA C1               POP BC
 435+ 6ACB DD 21 F8 86      LD IX, BgSpriteBuffer
 436+ 6ACF CD E0 DB         CALL DrawBgSpriteXOR                    ; XOR-erase
 437+ 6AD2 C9               RET
 438+ 6AD3 00           .eseTargetId: DEFB 0
