 180  75A2                  ; --- Bank cutscene: thunks slot 1 + body en bank 7 (M9) ---
 181  75A2                  ; CheckBankTriggerBg / UpdateBankCutscene aqui (entry thunks que paginan
 182  75A2                  ; bank 7 + CALL body + JP _PageBank0). Helpers _PageBank0/_PageBank7
 183  75A2                  ; compartidos por todos los CALLs externos que el body hace a bank 0
 184  75A2                  ; (DrawBgSpriteXOR, PlaySFX, RedrawPickupByPtr, CheckMilestoneTrigger,
 185  75A2                  ; DrawBgGfxSprite) y a slot 1 que internamente toca bank 0
