 120+ 75E3 CD A2 75         CALL _PageBank0
 121+ 75E6 CD 6D D1         CALL DrawBgGfxSprite
 122+ 75E9 C3 B4 75         JP _PageBank7
 123+ 75EC
 124+ 75EC              RedrawPickupByPtr_B7:
 125+ 75EC CD A2 75         CALL _PageBank0
 126+ 75EF CD 11 D8         CALL RedrawPickupByPtr
 127+ 75F2 C3 B4 75         JP _PageBank7
 128+ 75F5
 129+ 75F5              PlaySFX_B7:                              ; HL = SFX data ptr (en bank 0)
 130+ 75F5 CD A2 75         CALL _PageBank0
 131+ 75F8 CD 8D F8         CALL PlaySFX
 132+ 75FB C3 B4 75         JP _PageBank7
 133+ 75FE
 134+ 75FE              CheckMilestoneTrigger_B7:                ; A = action id
 135+ 75FE CD A2 75         CALL _PageBank0
 136+ 7601 CD D4 EE         CALL CheckMilestoneTrigger
 137+ 7604 C3 B4 75         JP _PageBank7
 138+ 7607
 139+ 7607              ; --- slot 1 callee con dependencia bank 0 interna ---
