 325+ 7730              ; ==============================================================================
 326+ 7730              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath - BFS reverse con state (sid, comp_local)
 327+ 7730              ; ==============================================================================
 328+ 7730              ; Algoritmo:
 329+ 7730              ;   1. queue.push((target_sid, target_comp=0)). Mark visited.
 330+ 7730              ;      target_comp = 0 (heurística: el pickup vive en la comp principal).
 331+ 7730              ;   2. While queue not empty:
 332+ 7730              ;        (R, R_comp) = queue.pop()
 333+ 7730              ;        For each gap in RoomCompGaps[R]:
 334+ 7730              ;          If gap.comp != R_comp: skip.
 335+ 7730              ;          V = neighbor of R via gap.side.
 336+ 7730              ;          Find V's gap with side=opposite(gap.side) AND coord=gap.coord.
 337+ 7730              ;          V_comp = that gap's comp.
 338+ 7730              ;          If (V, V_comp) visited: skip.
 339+ 7730              ;          If V == current_sid AND V_comp == player_current_comp:
 340+ 7730              ;            dir_player = opposite(gap.side); STORE; RETURN.
 341+ 7730              ;          Mark visited; queue.push((V, V_comp)).
 342+ 7730              ;
 343+ 7730              ; player_current_comp se determina via LastEntrySide:
 344+ 7730              ;   - LastEntrySide = side por el que el player entró a current_sid.
 345+ 7730              ;   - player_comp = comp del gap de current_sid en LastEntrySide.
 346+ 7730              ;   - Si LastEntrySide = $FF (boot/respawn), comp = 0 (fallback).
 347+ 7730              ;
 348+ 7730              ; OUT: MagicCompassPathDir = 0=N, 1=E, 2=S, 3=W; o $FF si sin path.
 349+ 7730              ; ==============================================================================
 350+ 7730              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath — wrapper que pagina bank 7 alrededor del BFS.
 351+ 7730              ; Las tablas RoomCompGaps_XX viven en bank 7 (movidas para liberar slot 1
 352+ 7730              ; del overflow). RoomCompGapsTable (pointer table) sigue en slot 1, pero
 353+ 7730              ; sus valores son addresses en $C000+ que solo se dereferencian con bank 7
 354+ 7730              ; paginado. El BFS body (renombrado a _Inner) solo llama a helpers .cmcp*
 355+ 7730              ; (todos en slot 1) — ningun CALL externo a bank 0.
 356+ 7730              ;
 357+ 7730              ; DIAGNOSTICO: revertido el SP alterno (commit e1e9c5f) para confirmar si era
 358+ 7730              ; la causa de "transiciones eternas al coger la brujula". Vuelta al patron DI
 359+ 7730              ; envolvente original.
 360+ 7730              ;
 361+ 7730              ; Mantiene DI durante todo el chunk BFS (~4000 T = 1/15 frame). Riesgo de
 362+ 7730              ; perder ~3 IRQ por segundo de compass activo, aceptable.
 363+ 7730              ; ==============================================================================
 364+ 7730              ComputeMagicCompassPath:
 365+ 7730 F3               DI
 366+ 7731                  ; --- Page bank 7 in slot 3 ---
 367+ 7731 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 368+ 7734 E6 F8            AND $F8
 369+ 7736 F6 07            OR 7
 370+ 7738 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 371+ 773B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 372+ 773E ED 79            OUT (C), A
 373+ 7740
 374+ 7740 CD 57 77         CALL _ComputeMagicCompassPath_Inner
 375+ 7743
 376+ 7743                  ; --- Page bank 0 back ---
 377+ 7743 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 378+ 7746 E6 F8            AND $F8
 379+ 7748 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 380+ 774B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 381+ 774E ED 79            OUT (C), A
 382+ 7750
 383+ 7750 3A 9D 81         LD A, (StartupComplete)
 384+ 7753 B7               OR A
 385+ 7754 C8               RET Z                                ; aún en Inicio: dejar DI
 386+ 7755 FB               EI
 387+ 7756 C9               RET
