 503+ 8FC5 86               ADD A, (HL)
 504+ 8FC6 32 BD 97         LD (MaiGapScreenId), A
 505+ 8FC9
 506+ 8FC9                  ; IFF tracking via StartupComplete (RAM) - evita race del LD A,I
 507+ 8FC9 F3               DI
 508+ 8FCA
 509+ 8FCA                  ; Inline page bank 6
 510+ 8FCA 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 511+ 8FCD E6 F8            AND $F8
 512+ 8FCF F6 06            OR 6
 513+ 8FD1 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 514+ 8FD4 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 515+ 8FD7 ED 79            OUT (C), A
