 716+ 90CC
 717+ 90CC              .mosHaveMatch:
 718+ 90CC                  ; C = count of matches. Pick random idx (into A, keep off C/B registers).
 719+ 90CC 41               LD B, C                         ; B = matches (divisor)
 720+ 90CD ED 5F            LD A, R
