1329+ 93FC 29               ADD HL, HL
1330+ 93FD 29               ADD HL, HL
1331+ 93FE 29               ADD HL, HL
1332+ 93FF 29               ADD HL, HL                              ; HL = cy * 32
1333+ 9400 7B               LD A, E
