1350+ 941C 7E               LD A, (HL)                              ; FlowField byte
1351+ 941D F5               PUSH AF
1352+ 941E 3A 85 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
1353+ 9421 E6 F8            AND $F8
1354+ 9423 32 85 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1355+ 9426 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1356+ 9429 ED 79            OUT (C), A
1357+ 942B 3A 9D 81         LD A, (StartupComplete)
1358+ 942E B7               OR A
1359+ 942F 28 01            JR Z, .cpzaNoEI
