 755+ A27D CD C0 B6         CALL CheckEnemyCollision
 756+ A280 28 16            JR Z, .peScaredSpriteToggle
 757+ A282                  ; Blocked: recompute slot (CheckEnemyCollision destruye DE/HL/BC)
 758+ A282 CD 3C 8F         CALL MaiGetMonsterSlot
 759+ A285 5F               LD E, A
 760+ A286 16 00            LD D, 0
 761+ A288 21 97 5F         LD HL, MonsterShakeOrigX
 762+ A28B 19               ADD HL, DE
 763+ A28C 7E               LD A, (HL)
