7280+ C77F              .bfsLoop:
7281+ C77F                  ; Queue empty?
7282+ C77F 2A 6B 5F         LD HL, (DBfsQHead)
7283+ C782 ED 5B 6D 5F      LD DE, (DBfsQTail)
