7600+ C975 32 CB 82         LD (TownGatePhase), A
7601+ C978 32 C9 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
7602+ C97B 32 D3 E2         LD (CurrentTimeOfDay), A            ; fase 0 = DY
7603+ C97E 32 B9 82         LD (BellsTriggered), A
