 398+ EC8C 21 11 40         LD HL, $4011                        ; Col 17, row 0, scan 0
 399+ EC8F 11 31 40         LD DE, $4031                        ; Col 17, row 1, scan 0
 400+ EC92 DD 21 5D E8      LD IX, BgGfx_hud_clock + 2 + 4      ; Sprite sano, offset 4 (cols 4-5)
