 559+ ED67 6B               LD L, E
 560+ ED68 A6               AND (HL)            ; borrar bit: (HL) AND ~mask
 561+ ED69 77               LD (HL), A
 562+ ED6A E1               POP HL
 563+ ED6B 18 ED            JR .pixLoop
