 506+ F084 3A C0 5F         LD A, (MagicCompassTimer + 1)
 507+ F087 B0               OR B
 508+ F088 C8               RET Z                               ; sin cambios + sin wobble + sin magic
 509+ F089 18 05            JR .dcRedraw
