1210+ F387              ; a CHURCH_CUTSCENE_TOTAL_FRAMES, dispara ApplyChurchTrapEffects + termina.
1211+ F387              ; (MVP1: solo freeze + reposicion; sin shake. MVP2 anadira jitter visible.)
