1066+ E219              ; Player redraw helpers — REUSADOS de town_gate_cutscene.asm (slot 1, always-vis):
1067+ E219              ;   TownGateRedrawPlayer:    erase old + draw new (cambio sprite/posicion).
1068+ E219              ;   TownGateDrawPlayerHere:  draw + attrs en (ENT_DRAWX, PlayerDrawY).
1069+ E219              ;   TownGateErasePlayer:     XOR-erase en (ENT_OLDX, ENT_OLDY) + RestoreOldAttr.
1070+ E219              ; Son rutinas puras del estado del player (no tocan ninguna var de town_gate),
